{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf1GnUmiq6ZAJrv8DzuwC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! All acceptance criteria are met. Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## Implementation Complete ✅\n\n### Changes Made:\n\n1. **Added new error code** (`SHIPMENT_CANNOT_BE_CONFIRMED`) to `ApiError.kt`\n   - Used for HTTP 409 responses when attempting to confirm a cancelled shipment\n\n2. **Implemented `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` endpoint** in `ShipmentController.kt`\n   - Moves `CREATED` shipments to `CONFIRMED` status\n   - Returns the confirmed shipment\n   - Handles idempotent retries (confirming already-`CONFIRMED` shipment succeeds without changes)\n   - Rejects `CANCELLED` shipments with HTTP 409\n   - Returns HTTP 404 for non-existent shipments\n\n3. **Added comprehensive tests** in `ShipmentControllerTest.kt`\n   - Confirm created shipment → CONFIRMED\n   - Confirm already confirmed shipment → succeeds (idempotent)\n   - Confirm cancelled shipment → HTTP 409 with proper error code\n   - Confirm non-existent shipment → HTTP 404\n\n### Test Results:\n- ✅ **17 tests pass** (5 original + 4 new shipment confirm tests + 8 from other modules)\n- ✅ **No failures or errors**\n- ✅ **No new Maven dependencies**\n- ✅ **Only shipment-feature files modified** (within constraints)\n\nThe implementation follows the existing Spring Boot + Kotlin patterns, uses the standard error envelope for consistency, and preserves full idempotency for operation retries."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1041,"cache_read_input_tokens":41219,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1041},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7b1893cf